@startuml cd1a_pair_players
!include style.iuml
title CD-1a  Pair players and assign colours - communication diagram from SD-1a
object "svc : GameService" as S
object "rec : GameRecord" as R
object "p1Profile : PlayerProfile" as P
object "g : Game" as G
object "b : Board" as B
S --> R : 1: find oldest waiting record [same size]\n2: blackLastSeen\n3b [host gone > 30 s]: status = cancelled\n4 [host active]: whitePlayer, whiteToken = newToken()\n5 [random() < 0.5]: swap seats\n6: status = in_progress
S --> P : 3 [host active]: get or create(name)
S --> G : 7: buildGame(rec)
G --> B : 7.1: <<create>> Board(size)\n7.2: initialize()
G --> G : 7.3: start()
@enduml
